---
// Static figure: how a stained-glass window is made, in four steps (after the V&A's introduction to medieval
// stained glass). Simple drawings of relationships — colour in the glass, cut pieces, fired paint, lead and iron —
// not a reconstruction of any Chartres window.
---
<figure class="glass-steps">
  <ol>
    <li>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 160 110" aria-hidden="true">
        <path class="gs-line" d="M30 30 H74 L68 80 H36 Z" />
        <path class="gs-melt" d="M37 58 H67 L65 76 H39 Z" />
        <rect class="gs-blue" x="96" y="26" width="48" height="30" />
        <rect class="gs-clear" x="96" y="66" width="48" height="16" />
        <rect class="gs-red" x="96" y="66" width="48" height="4" />
        <path class="gs-line" d="M78 50 H90" marker-end="url(#gs-arrow)" />
        <defs><marker id="gs-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 Z" /></marker></defs>
      </svg>
      <p><strong>熔出彩色玻璃</strong>在熔化的沙与草木灰中加入金属氧化物，整块玻璃就带了颜色。红色太深、不透光，便在无色玻璃上覆一层薄薄的红玻璃（下方小图）。</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 160 110" aria-hidden="true">
        <rect class="gs-blue" x="20" y="18" width="120" height="74" />
        <path class="gs-cut" d="M20 52 Q60 40 84 60 T140 50 M70 18 Q64 46 84 60 Q92 78 86 92" />
      </svg>
      <p><strong>切成小块</strong>依照设计图，用加热的铁器在玻璃上划开，再用一种带槽的铁钩把边缘一点点修成需要的形状。</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 160 110" aria-hidden="true">
        <path class="gs-skin" d="M30 20 H86 V92 H30 Z" />
        <path class="gs-paint" d="M44 38 Q50 34 56 38 M62 38 Q68 34 74 38 M47 44 H53 M65 44 H71 M59 44 Q57 54 61 58 M36 92 Q46 70 56 92 M60 92 Q70 68 82 92" />
        <path class="gs-line" d="M104 92 V44 Q120 28 136 44 V92 Z" />
        <path class="gs-heat" d="M112 80 Q116 72 112 64 M120 80 Q124 70 120 60 M128 80 Q132 72 128 64" />
      </svg>
      <p><strong>描画、入窑</strong>用含铁或铜氧化物的深色玻璃颜料画出脸、衣褶和轮廓，再入窑烧，让颜料熔结在玻璃上。</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 160 110" aria-hidden="true">
        <rect class="gs-blue" x="14" y="14" width="40" height="40" />
        <rect class="gs-skin" x="54" y="14" width="40" height="40" />
        <rect class="gs-redfill" x="14" y="54" width="40" height="40" />
        <rect class="gs-blue" x="54" y="54" width="40" height="40" />
        <path class="gs-lead" d="M14 14 H94 V94 H14 Z M54 14 V94 M14 54 H94" />
        <path class="gs-iron" d="M8 54 H100" />
        <path class="gs-came" d="M118 34 H146 M118 66 H146 M132 34 V66" />
        <text class="gs-label" x="132" y="84" text-anchor="middle">铅条截面</text>
      </svg>
      <p><strong>铅条拼合、铁框支撑</strong>把各块玻璃嵌进截面呈“工”字形的铅条，焊牢，抹油灰防水；拼好的整片再固定到窗洞里的铁框上（图中横穿的粗线）。</p>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <figcaption>示意图：四个步骤之间的关系，依据维多利亚与阿尔伯特博物馆对中世纪彩窗工艺的介绍绘制；不是对沙特尔某一扇窗的复原，颜色与比例为示意。</figcaption>
</figure>
